---
// Help panel listing available CLI commands
---

<aside class="help-panel">
  <div class="help-section">
    <h2>Help</h2>
    <div class="help-list">
      <div>`new point A 0,0`</div>
      <div>`add point B 2,3`</div>
      <div>`add lineSegment AB`</div>
      <div>`add lineSegment A B`</div>
      <div>`add line L A B`</div>
      <div>`add line L AB`</div>
      <div>`add line L segment AB`</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="help-section">
    <h3>Constraints</h3>
    <div class="help-list">
      <div>`lock point A`</div>
      <div>`unlock point A`</div>
      <div>`perpendicular line L1 line L2`</div>
      <div>`perpendicular segment AB segment CD`</div>
      <div>`perpendicular line L1 segment AB`</div>
      <div>`parallel line L1 line L2`</div>
      <div>`parallel segment AB segment CD`</div>
      <div>`parallel line L1 segment AB`</div>
      <div>`equal segment AB segment CD`</div>
    </div>
    <div class="help-note">Use these after creating the referenced points/lines/segments.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="help-section">
    <h3>Camera</h3>
    <div class="help-list">
      <div>`Right-click + drag` pan view</div>
      <div>`Mouse wheel` zoom at cursor</div>
      <div>`Left-click + drag point` move point</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .help-panel {
    width: 280px;
    min-width: 240px;
    max-width: 340px;
    padding: 24px;
    background-color: #141414;
    border-right: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .help-panel h2 {
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ffa500;
  }

  .help-panel h3 {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ffa500;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .help-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .help-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #cfcfcf;
  }

  .help-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #8a8a8a;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
